OL,3,CUK could see hottest day of year as
OL,4,Cparts of England may hit 38C
OL,6,FThe UK could see its hottest day of
OL,7,Fthe year so far as parts of England
OL,8,Fmay hit 38C during the peak of the
OL,9,Ffifth heatwave of the summer.
OL,11,FRare amber "extreme heat" warnings
OL,12,Fhave been issued by the Met Office for
OL,13,FLondon and parts of the South East,
OL,14,FEast Midlands, East of England, West
OL,15,FMidlands and South Yorkshire from 9am
OL,16,Fto midnight on Thursday.
OL,26,@sD@LOUsD@YO]
