OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786652305
OL,3,CUK could see hottest day of year as
OL,4,Cparts of England may hit 38C
OL,6,FHe added: "It could be the hottest day
OL,7,Fof the year so far if we get above
OL,8,F38C, and if we get above 38.5C, well
OL,9,Fit could be the hottest August day on
OL,10,Frecord, but that's actually pretty
OL,11,Funlikely."
OL,13,FThe highest temperature of the year
OL,14,Fwas 38C recorded at Lingwood in
OL,15,FNorfolk on June 28.
OL,17,FIt comes as England and Wales have
OL,18,Falready seen as many wildfires this
OL,19,Fyear as in the whole of 2025.
OL,26,@nD@KOUsD@JO]
