OL,3,CUK could see hottest day of year as
OL,4,Cparts of England may hit 38C
OL,6,FSome 1,017 wildfires have been
OL,7,Frecorded in England and Wales this
OL,8,Fyear, according to data shared by the
OL,9,FNational Fire Chiefs Council (NFCC),
OL,10,Fthe same as last year's record-
OL,11,Fbreaking total.
OL,13,FCrews from Hampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,14,FFire and Rescue Service have continued
OL,15,Fbattling a blaze which hit protected
OL,16,Fheathland in the New Forest after a
OL,17,Fvan caught fire on the A31 near
OL,18,FRingwood on Sunday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
