PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786652305
OL,3,CUK could see hottest day of year as
OL,4,Cparts of England may hit 38C
OL,6,FIn an update on Wednesday evening, the
OL,7,Ffire service said crews expect to be
OL,8,Fat the scene for at least another
OL,9,Fthree to four days.
OL,11,FMost major UK supermarkets have
OL,12,Fstopped sales of disposable barbecues
OL,13,Fin recent weeks in line with voluntary
OL,14,Fguidance from the NFCC.
OL,16,FMr Burnham has urged all shops to stop
OL,17,Fselling them and indicated that an
OL,18,Foutright ban could be considered in
OL,19,Ffuture summers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
