CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786652305
OL,3,CUK could see hottest day of year as
OL,4,Cparts of England may hit 38C
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister also said that
OL,7,Fthere had been a "significant number
OL,8,Fof excess deaths from heat this summer
OL,9,Falready" and urged the public to
OL,10,Ffollow health advice, including
OL,11,Fchecking in on elderly friends and
OL,12,Frelatives.
OL,14,FTwo record-breaking heatwaves in May
OL,15,Fand June led to more than 2,800 excess
OL,16,Fdeaths.
OL,26,@oD@ROUqD@HO]
