OL,3,CUK could see hottest day of year as
OL,4,Cparts of England may hit 38C
OL,6,FThe Royal College of Nursing has
OL,7,Fwarned that nurses are collapsing at
OL,8,Fwork and are being forced to care for
OL,9,Fpatients in temperatures in excess of
OL,10,F30C.
OL,12,FOthers have reported seizures and
OL,13,F"dripping with sweat from head to
OL,14,Ftoe", and nurses have said patients
OL,15,Fare being cared for in hospitals which
OL,16,Fhave been described as "unbearably
OL,17,Fhot" and "not fit for humans".
OL,26,@uD@AOUvD@DO]xD@XOUyD@DO]yD@JOUyD@]O]
