OL,3,CUK could see hottest day of year as
OL,4,Cparts of England may hit 38C
OL,6,FNearly three-quarters of England and
OL,7,Fthe whole of Wales are in drought,
OL,8,Fheaping pressure on water resources
OL,9,Ffor households, agriculture and the
OL,10,Fenvironment.
OL,12,FBaroness Brown, who chairs the
OL,13,Findependent advisory Climate Change
OL,14,FCommittee's adaptation work, warned it
OL,15,F"gets worse from here" until the
OL,16,Fgreenhouse gas emissions ` mostly
OL,17,Fcaused by burning fossil fuels in
OL,18,Fpower plants, vehicles, home heating
OL,19,Fand industry ` behind global warming
OL,20,Fare cut to zero overall, known as net
OL,21,Fzero.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@VO]
