OL,3,CUK could see hottest day of year as
OL,4,Cparts of England may hit 38C
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Chiltern Railways and East
OL,7,FMidlands Railway have issued alerts to
OL,8,F"only travel if essential".
OL,10,FOther operators will either run a
OL,11,Freduced timetable or are warning about
OL,12,Fthe potential for short-notice
OL,13,Fcancellations.
